{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064039/block/singleImage/3268606/df/1607854678_Mt.jpg?updatedAt=1794819478\"/><figcaption>紅磡58歲男子墮樓，當場不治。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>今日 (16 日 ) 上午 8 時 44 分，警方接獲保安報案，指發現一名男子倒臥在愛景街 8 號屋苑對開，懷疑他從高處墮下。 人員接報到場，該名 58 歲姓黃男子現場被證實死亡。人員經初步調查，相信他從上址一單位墮下。警方於現場沒有檢獲遺書，死因有待驗屍後確定。據悉，事主生前受情緒病困擾。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T09:35:43.864084+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":168,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T08:57:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T10:09:41.816273+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T09:29:10.047274+00:00","content_hash":"cbf03265a844fe99faef138934f27e04ac467812a63936e81fd81dd2b22aa3da","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}